# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
Visual RSI regime EA only — no trading.

## Regime (v1.27 buy support lookback)
- Resist = highest swing clearly >65 (gap 2) — never weak near-65 spike
- Support = lowest swing clearly <35 on BUY enter (lookback) + during buy
- Leave SELL: cross INV + stay above 65 (spike reject = stay SELL)
- Leave BUY: break INV + stay below 35 (bounce cancels)
- Regime colour lock after enter (hold+confirm)
- No mid-range capFail SELL

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Modules: Buy/Sell/Regime/SR/Draw + Types
- Bg black; strips/boxes/signals via Phase_Draw

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(14), levels 20/35/40/50/60/65/80

